---
import GAHTWikiLayout from '../../layouts/block-wiki/GAHTWikiLayout.astro'
---

<GAHTWikiLayout>
	<section style="padding-top: 8px;">
		<h5 style="text-align: center;">Downloads</h5>
		<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; gap: 32px; padding-top: 16px; justify-content: center;">
			<a class="rect-box" href="https://modrinth.com/project/mHCp97rc" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
				Modrinth
			</a>
			<a class="rect-box" href="https://github.com/Lumelore/gahtmod" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
				GitHub
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section>
		<p>The GAHT (Gender Affirming Hormone Therapy) mod adds GAHT to Minecraft in the form of new items and effects.</p>
		
		<p>Three New Effects:</p>

		<ul>
			<li>Girl Power</li>
			<li>Boy Power</li>
			<li>Enby Power</li>
		</ul>
	</section>
	<section>
		<h3>Air Dash!</h3>
		<p>Use Girl Power or Boy Power to perform a dash by jumping while in mid-air. Both can be used simultaneously to reduce cooldown time.</p>
	</section>
	<section>
		<h3>Wall Slide!</h3>
		<p>Use Enby Power to climb any wall like it's a ladder. You can even crouch to stay in place! Plus, Enby Power reduces fall damage by half while active.</p>
	</section>
	<section>
		<h4>And More!</h4>
		<p>Use a Bottle of Agender to store your gender effects for later. Bottles of Genderfluid can give you random genders. Plus, you can use hormone blockers to remove the ones you don't want.</p>
	</section>

</GAHTWikiLayout>